_b2cac4a5c61dff0e9648f9c83a037d20200e0fa4.600x338.jpg?t=1744646632"}],"short_description":"The year is... probably 2025. Humans created the ultimate mosquito repellent. If it launches \u2014 game over. Now the bugs bite back. Play as a bloodthirsty mosquito or the last human standing in this fast-paced, asymmetric multiplayer game. Slap, dodge, and survive!","steam_appid":2811100,"support_info":{"email":"mosquito@space-raccoon.com","url":"https://space-raccoon.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}